OL,3,GNEWSATeens arrested in connection to
OL,4,Asexual assault
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree teenage boys have been arrested
OL,7,Fin connection to a sexual assault.
OL,9,FDevon and Cornwall Police said officers
OL,10,Fwere called to a report of a woman
OL,11,Fhaving been sexually assaulted in the
OL,12,FCarlton Way area of Liskeard, Cornwall.
OL,14,FOfficers were called at about 20:10 BST
OL,15,Fon Wednesday and following extensive
OL,16,Finquiries, three teenage boys aged 15,
OL,17,F14 and 13 were taken into custody.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
